MECHANISM: instance-level forward override (types.MethodType stored in block.__dict__["forward"]) on interactions.0/1.
  The copied forwards are verbatim mace 0.3.17 (sha256 of class forward source checked at install; install refuses on drift),
  keep the `hasattr(self,"conv_fusion")` FlashTP branch, lammps/truncate_ghosts. Stock submodules are NOT replaced (state_dict
  unchanged); uninstall pops the override + op table. Weights are snapshotted at install; a param._version guard raises if
  the source weights are modified afterwards. Refuses: double install, non-e3nn linear/skip_tp, cueq reshape, biases,
  non-fp64/non-CUDA model, other interaction classes.

